/-- **Scale-Free Universal-in-`Q` Single-Time `LhBandAgree` 1-Step Fixed-Column Jump to `true` (`lhCenter_step_one_eq_true_at_shift_of_zero_diag_and_single_lhBandAgree`, 9.846)**:
