/-- **Producing `LhBandAgree t (m * P) 0 (S + 1)` Directly from `RhColAgree t (m * P) 1 S` Under `CenterPeriodic` (`periodic_lhBandAgree_zero_of_rhColAgree_one`, 9.847)**:
