/-- **Producing Center-Anchored `LhBandAgree (t + s) (m * P) 0 (L + 1)` at Every Intermediate Step `t + s` from `RhColAgree t (m * P) 1 (L + s)` (`periodic_lhBandAgree_steps_of_rhColAgree_one`, 9.848)**:
