/-- **Scale-Free Universal-in-`Q` Single-Time `LhBandAgree` Linearization 2 Below Any Zero Diagonal (`lhCenter_linear_step_two_at_shift_of_zero_diag_and_lhBandAgree`, 9.851)**:
