/-- **Scale-Free Universal-in-`Q` Single-Time `LhBandAgree` Twin Cancellation Pinning `lhCenter (t + 1) (p + 1) = false` (`lhCenter_step_one_eq_false_at_shift_of_zero_diag_and_single_lhBandAgree`, 9.852)**:
