/-- **Scale-Free General-`Q` Single-Time Refutation of `LhBandAgree t Q p0 L` When Both `t - (p + 2)` and `(t + Q) - p` Are Zero Diagonals (`not_lhBandAgree_of_zero_diag_two_and_shift_zero_diag`, 9.853)**:
