/-- **Scale-Free Real-Orbit Single-Time Refutation `¬ LhBandAgree t 3 p0 L` at Any Period-3 Doubling Zero Diagonal `z = t - (p + 1)` Without `LhBandAgree (t + 1..2)`, `settle (z + 3)`, or Scale `k` (`not_lhBandAgree_three_of_doubles`, 9.891)**:
