/-- **Inside-the-Cone `m * P`-Defect Lock Between `maskparity · k` and `leftresponse · k` Under `CenterPeriodic T P` (`periodic_maskparity_defect_eq_leftresponse_defect_cone_mul`, 9.946)**:
