/-- **Dyadic (`2^k - m * P`) Refutation of `CenterPeriodic` from Same-Drive `rdrv` Column-`1` Agreement (`not_centerPeriodic_of_rdrv_one_agree_sub_twopow_ge`, 9.1070)**:
