/-- **Dyadic (`2^k - m * P`) Refutation of `CenterPeriodic` from Spatial Right-Half Slice Agreement `RhBandAgree (2^k - m * P) (m * P) 1 S` (`not_centerPeriodic_of_rhBandAgree_one_sub_twopow_ge`, 9.1071)**:
