/-- **White Prefix Forced by a White Column-`1` Cell During a White Drive Run (`rdrv_white_prefix_forced_of_col_one_white`, 9.1219, `Rule30WhitePulse.white_prefix_forced` in `rdrv`, `kit [33]`)**:
