/-- **Sub-Diagonal `H`-Shift Defect Invariance (`accum_shift`) in `rdrv` (`rdrv_subdiag_accum_shift_xor`, 9.1227, `Rule30RightPeriods.accum_shift` in `rdrv`, `kit [33]`)**:
