/-- **Infinite-Horizon Trapezoid Determination `p ≤ s + (B + 1)` from `RhBandAgree` and a `2^k`-Bounded Super-Diagonal Gate (`rdrv_trapezoid_agree_of_superdiag_gate_twopow`, 9.1247, `kit [33]`)**:
