/-- **Infinite-Horizon Trapezoid Determination `p ≤ s + (B + 1)` Under `IsRightThreshold k J` from a `2^k`-Bounded Super-Diagonal Gate (`rdrv_trapezoid_agree_of_superdiag_gate_threshold`, 9.1248, `kit [33]`)**:
