    under `CenterPeriodic T P` (`0 < P`), for all `m, t, B, s ∈ ℕ` with `T ≤ t` and `s ≤ B`, if `RhBandAgree t (m * P) 1 B`, then `RhBandAgree (t + s) (m * P) 1 (B - s)`! -/
