/-- **Gate-Free Column-`1` Agreement `rhCenter ((t + s) + m * P) 1 = rhCenter (t + s) 1` from `RhBandAgree t (m * P) 1 B` (`periodic_rhCenter_one_agree_of_rhBandAgree`, 9.1260, `kit [33]`)**:
