      rdrv_main_diag_period_twopow_succ_mul td (tx + Q) k (u % twopow (k + 1)) (u / twopow (k + 1)) htc,
      rdrv_main_diag_period_twopow_succ_mul td tx k (u % twopow (k + 1)) (u / twopow (k + 1)) (by omega)]
  exact h (u % twopow (k + 1)) hr

