/-- **Unconditional Agreement of Two Driven Trajectories `tx2, tx` at Dyadic Sub-Diagonal Multiples `v * 2^((k + 1) + c)` (`rdrv_subdiag_at_twopow_all_agree`, 9.1302, `kit [33]`)**:
