/-- **Common-Scale (`t + Q ≤ K`) Pullback of `RhBandAgree t Q a B` from Shifted Row `t + v * 2^K` (`rhBandAgree_of_dyadic_row_scale_agree`, 9.1355, `kit [33]`)**:
