/-- **Delay-Free Full Embedding of the Left Half `lhCenter j d` Inside the Right Half `rhCenter` to the Left of `U = v * 2^C` (`rhCenter_dyadic_sub_eq_lhCenter_zero_delay`, 9.1381, `kit [33]`)**:
