/-- **Pointwise Pullback of `lhCenter ((t + s) + Q) d = lhCenter (t + s) d` from Right-Half Column `v * 2^K - d` Agreement (`lhCenter_shift_agree_of_rhCenter_dyadic_sub_agree`, 9.1391, `kit [33]`)**:
