/-- **Pullback of `LhColAgree t Q d S` from Right-Half Column Agreement `RhColAgree (t + v * 2^K) Q (v * 2^K - d) S` (`lhColAgree_of_rhColAgree_dyadic_sub`, 9.1392, `kit [33]`)**:
