/-- **Zero-Diagonal Pair Refutation of `CenterPeriodic` from Right-Half Column `v * 2^K - 1` Agreement (`not_centerPeriodic_of_rhColAgree_dyadic_pred_col_at_zero_diag_pair`, 9.1397, `kit [33]`)**:
