/-- **9.1541**: At `t = z + 1` (`p0 = 1`), single-row spatial `Q`-periodicity on `[1 + 2^k, 1 + 2^k + S]` at `((z + 1) + Q) + 2^k` implies `LhBandAgree ((z + 1) + 2^k) Q (1 + 2^k) S`, requiring ONLY late settlement at `(z + 1) + 2^k`! -/
